    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the old bouncing <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> screensaver?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wished it was an idle game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REPRESENTING:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><i>DvD</i></strong> Idle Game, an nostalgic 2000's idle game with bouncing <strong><i>DvD's</i></strong>, increasing profits and lots of extra 2000's like technology implemented in an idle game</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Shops:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Shop</strong> \u2013 Upgrade speed, multiplier, number of discs, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dial-Up Internet</strong> \u2013 Activate for bandwidth multipliers. Upgrade delay, duration, and power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Unlock new disc colors, visual filters, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>DVD</i> Burner</strong> \u2013 Burn your progress to unlock powerful upgrades and new shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Viruses</strong> \u2013 Stop the viruses before they destroy your discs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torrenting </strong>-<strong>\u00a0</strong>Download music with your bandwidth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CD Burning</strong> \u2013 burn CDs from your torrented music, and sell them for profit.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more...</strong> hidden secrets, upgrades, and surprises await.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lots of Achievements: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of achievements\u2014can you collect them all?</p>",
